        <headline>Warning to Sheep Graziers for Yorke Peninsula forecast district</headline>
        <description>Sheep graziers are warned that cold temperatures, rain and showers and southerly winds are expected during Tuesday. Areas likely to be affected include parts of the Yorke Peninsula forecast district. There is a risk of losses of lambs and sheep exposed to these conditions.</description>
